  <name>XYKBMS Keyboard Configuration</name>
  <summary>Configure and update XY ThinkPad keyboard controller boards</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      A native replacement for the Windows XYKBMS_SwUpdate tool, used to configure
      and update the XY ThinkPad classic keyboard to USB-C converter boards.
    </p>
    <p>Features include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Read, modify and write the keyboard configuration</li>
      <li>Load pin and layer configuration files to change the key map</li>
      <li>Read scan codes to build your own key map</li>
      <li>Show the firmware version and battery voltage, and set the backlight level</li>
      <li>Upgrade the BOOT, APP and USB firmware</li>
      <li>Open and save configuration backups</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.hughsie.xykbms-gtk.desktop</launchable>
